  "answer": "A",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$T_1 = 327 + 273 = 600$ K.\n\n$$\\eta = 1 - \\frac{T_2}{T_1} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; 0.5 = 1 - \\frac{T_2}{600} \\;\\Rightarrow\\; T_2 = 300\\ \\text{K} = 27°\\text{C}$$",
